        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: Seattle SuperSonics, Phoenix Suns\n- Places: Western Conference, Phoenix, Arizona\n- Events: 1975–76 Seattle SuperSonics season, NBA playoffs, Conference Semifinals\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1975–76 season, the Seattle SuperSonics finished second in the Western Conference with a 43–39 record.\n- In the 1975–76 season, the Seattle SuperSonics matched their previous season's 43–39 record.\n- In the 1975–76 season, the Seattle SuperSonics reached the playoffs for a second consecutive season.\n- In the 1975–76 NBA playoffs, the Phoenix Suns defeated the Seattle SuperSonics in the Conference Semifinals in six games.\n- The Phoenix Suns are an American professional basketball team based in Phoenix, Arizona.",
